==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|uttermost}}, {{m|enm|uttirmest}}, {{m|enm|uttermast}}, {{m|enm|outemast}}, alteration (due to {{cog|enm|outre|t=outer}}) of {{inh|en|ang|ūtemest}}, {{m|ang|ȳtemest|t=outermost}}, equivalent to {{suf|en|outer|most}}. {{doublet|en|uttermost}}.

